==Trivia==
The standard print of this card is part of a narrative illustration with {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Pidgey|186}} and {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Pidgeot|188}} from the same set. In this illustration, a Pidgeotto has flown down to perch on the same tree branch as the two Pidgey from the previous card. All three cards are illustrated by [[Scav]] and form the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Pidgey Squad" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pidgeotto}}.
*{{m|Gust}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pidgeotto}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

